Subject: [PATCH 1983/5749] feat(background-agent): add "interrupt" to
 BackgroundTaskStatus type

Add interrupt as a terminal status for background tasks that fail due to promptAsync errors (e.g., prompt exceed, agent not found).

Ultraworked with [Sisyphus](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-opencode)

Co-authored-by: Sisyphus <clio-agent@sisyphuslabs.ai>
---
 src/features/background-agent/types.ts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/features/background-agent/types.ts b/src/features/background-agent/types.ts
index 553f5bb5..fd5309dc 100644
--- a/src/features/background-agent/types.ts
+++ b/src/features/background-agent/types.ts
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@ export type BackgroundTaskStatus =
   | "completed"
   | "error"
   | "cancelled"
+  | "interrupt"
 
 export interface TaskProgress {
   toolCalls: number
